[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここまで上ってきたか。\n素直に牢へ向かっていればいいものを",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you made it this far. You should have gone straight to the prison like good little prisoners."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どの道、外に逃がすつもりはないがな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Either way, I never intended to let you escape."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつが、堂免鏑矢……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is Kaburaya Doumen...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コウセンがいない……\n牢屋のほうに戦力を割いたんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen isn't here... He must have diverted his forces to the prison!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前たちの他に別動隊がおる場合に備えてな。\n余が信じられる者は、もはや奴のみよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In case you had another team elsewhere. He's the only one I can trust now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "千歳……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいえ、堂免卿。どうかお耳にお入れください。\nあなたの束縛を解く道具を用意いたしましたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, Lady Doumen. Please, hear me out. I've prepared something to break your bonds."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは……お香？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that... incense?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "香には香を……君を目覚めさせるため、\n錬金術士たちが作り上げた叡智の結晶だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fighting fire with fire... This is the crystallization of alchemical wisdom, crafted to bring you to your senses."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだ玉涎香を疑っているのか。こちらでも調べさせたが\nただの安眠を誘う香という結果が出たが？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still suspicious of the Jade Nectar? I had it investigated as well—the results showed it was merely incense to induce peaceful sleep."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、違うのよ。このお香を使えば理性を取り戻せ――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That can't be right. If you use this incense, you'll be able to see reason—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ！\u3000今、この場に理性は必要か？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha! Is 'reason' what I need right now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "知らん顔ばかりだが、どいつもこいつも強そうだ。\nこの刀を振るうのに不足はない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't recognize most of you, but you all look strong. Perfect opponents for my blade!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今、この場に必要なのは、武だ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right this moment, what I need is battle!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつ……タガが外れてるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's... completely lost it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "余を縛る枷など最初から無い！\n余は、余が思うがままに暴れ、屠るッ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was never bound by any chains to begin with! My rage is my own, and I kill as I please!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわ、あっぶなぁ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa, that was close...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "香を嗅がせるにしても、まずはこの興奮状態を解いて\n大人しくさせる必要があるだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if we want her take the incense, we'll need to calm her down first."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、そうね……これじゃ話にならないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, you're right... We're not getting anywhere with this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "迎撃しますわよ、ディオーナ、ミーケ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll intercept her! Diona, Mieke!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ふたり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆さん、すみません……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone, I'm so sorry...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "千歳さん……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大切な人に尽くす気持ち、私には分かるわ。\n立場は違えど志は同じだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand the feeling of wanting to serve someone precious to you. Our positions may differ, but our hearts are the same."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "千歳は何があっても鏑矢の味方なんだよね？\nいいよ、気にせず思いっきり来ーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose will always be on Kaburaya's side no matter what, right? That's fine—don't hold back and give it everything you've got!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢様……お供いたしとう、ございます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My lord... allow me to serve by your side!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……勝手にしろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...If that's what you want."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあああああ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haaaaaaah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]